WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.400
Reach towards the blue pepper

2
00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:06.000
Grasp the blue pepper

3
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:07.800
Move the blue pepper to the right of the burner

4
00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:10.600
Release the blue pepper on the burner

5
00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:11.200
Move away from the burner
